## 📂 Dataset

The cervical cell images used in this project were obtained from the
**Cervical Cell Image Database** available on Zenodo.

🔗 **Dataset:**  
https://zenodo.org/records/20149084

The dataset contains cervical cell microscopy images used for
deep learning-based cervical cell classification.

For this project, the relevant classes were organized into:

- 🟢 Normal
- 🟡 Moderate Dysplastic
- 🔴 Severe Dysplastic

The final dataset was balanced to 292 images per class,
resulting in 876 images used for the classification experiment.
